  - m_Id: 21402280185802764
    m_Localized: Eat smaller planets. Steer clear of larger planets and their orbiting moons.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21402280185802765
    m_Localized: Comets move fast. A direct hit costs mass. Steer around the comet or follow its trail for food.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21402280185802766
    m_Localized: A black hole pulls planets inward. Its core drains mass. Stay outside the ring to avoid the pull.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21402280185802767
    m_Localized: Your planet evolved. Moons orbit you and can strike rivals. Choose a perk for this run.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21402280185802768
    m_Localized: You gained a rank. Runs earn XP and each new rank awards stardust. Spend it on planets in your profile.
